      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "なんとか撃退はできたけど、\r\nまたここで襲われるかもしれない……。",
        "official_en": "We managed to fight it off, but it probably won’t be long until it attacks us again.",
        "real_en": "We managed to drive it off, but it might attack us here again..."
