      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "今の俺たちでは倒しきれないだろう……\r\nときには逃げることも重要だぞ。",
        "official_en": "I believe we currently do not have the strength to overcome it. Rain, I’ll remind you that fleeing is a perfectly viable tactic.",
        "real_en": "I don't think we can defeat it as we are... Sometimes running away is important, too."
      },
